"I thought Mr. Hašek was smarter and more intelligent."
"Because I've never seen something so eagerly executed in my life," the TOP 09 chairman added.
And towards President Zeman (whom he clashed in the fight for the presidency), he said: "The role of the head of state is clear: He wants to seize that party."
The first laws have already been submitted by TOP 09.
What was the biggest surprise of the election for you personally?
TOP 09 has already formally submitted its first bills in the Chamber of Deputies, including the Farsky Register of Treaties, which was discussed by House committees before the elections, but fell under the table with early elections.
In an interview with Aktuálně.cz, the chairman of TOP 09 argues that such speed is due to the fact that "these laws are needed".
